'''I'll Be Bug (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] unlocked after clearing [[Queen's Condemnation]].  It was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] and appears on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''', and '''16th''' of every month. When clearing this stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

